@startuml fig5_ecs_schema
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Liberation Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam participantBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #888888
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #555555

actor       "Client\n(Brussels, 192.51.100.42)" as C
participant "Recursive resolver\n(Google 8.8.8.8, US)" as R
participant "CDN Authoritative server\n(Akamai / Cloudflare)" as AUTH

== Without ECS ==

C  -> R    : Query: A cdn.example.com ?
R  -> AUTH : Query: A cdn.example.com ?\n[no ECS — source IP: 8.8.8.8]
note right of AUTH : CDN infers location\nfrom resolver IP (US)\n→ assigns US edge server
AUTH --> R : Answer: A 104.17.200.1  (US PoP,  TTL = 60 s)
R  --> C   : A 104.17.200.1  [suboptimal: +35 ms vs EU PoP]

== With ECS (RFC 7871) ==

C  -> R    : Query: A cdn.example.com ?
note right of R : Resolver embeds\nclient prefix /24\nin ECS EDNS option
R  -> AUTH : Query: A cdn.example.com ?\n[ECS option: 192.51.100.0/24]
note right of AUTH : CDN infers location\nfrom client prefix (BE)\n→ assigns EU edge server
AUTH --> R : Answer: A 198.41.128.1  (EU PoP,  TTL = 60 s)\n[ECS scope: /24]
R  --> C   : A 198.41.128.1  [optimal EU PoP]

== ECS opt-out (subnet=0/0) ==

C  -> R    : Query: A cdn.example.com ?\n[dig +subnet=0/0]
note right of R : ECS suppressed\n(privacy mode)
R  -> AUTH : Query: A cdn.example.com ?\n[ECS prefix: 0.0.0.0/0]
AUTH --> R : Answer: A 104.17.200.1  (anycast default,  TTL = 60 s)
R  --> C   : A 104.17.200.1

@enduml
